# Build inputs: large, refetchable, never committed.
/data/cache/

# Build outputs live in site/data/ and ARE committed -- they are the artifact
# that makes the site reproducible without re-running a 7-minute manifest crawl.

# The per-manuscript pages: 2,201 files and 24 MB, regenerated in seconds from
# the committed JSON by scripts/make_pages.py, and by CI before it deploys.
# site/browse.html and site/sitemap.xml ARE committed, because they are small
# and the test suite checks them for staleness.
site/ms/
